From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:49:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Player volume: 50 fine steps, dot column on the left, -/+ on
 the top bar

The system volume has 15 steps; the player now offers 50 (2 %): the
system volume goes to the step just above and the player attenuates the
rest. While the volume changes (keys, swipe, buttons) a column of gold
dots with the percentage shows on the left. The side volume bar that
took room from the controls is replaced by -/+ on the top bar.
